# Training model catalog

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-TRAINING-MODEL-CATALOG.md`. Inherits TR-00. Do not wire from it until the user feeds TR-01 (registry) or TR-02 (pipeline).

Pattern: zip + captions + trigger → gated trainer → `.safetensors` + config → matching `/lora` inference. Verify OpenAPI + `llms.txt` before any endpoint id. Primary cast trainer is MiniMax H3 ref2va. Style uses H3 t2v / LTX-2 / FLUX.2. Music/SFX uses Stable Audio 3. SAM 3 is dataset prep, not a generator. Orchestrator selects the trainer and assembles that trainer's dataset shape; it does not guess ids.
